      "6_batteries_nepsy_ii_d_kefs_wraml_2_cv": "6 batteries (NEPSY-II, D-KEFS, WRAML-2, CVLT-C, Luria-Nebraska, NIH Toolbox), 7 neuropsych domains with targeted assessments, neuropsych vs school-psych scope comparison, when to refer out.",
      "6_core_neuropsych_batteries": "6 core neuropsych batteries",
      "70_narrow_abilities_the_level_individu": " (~70 narrow abilities — the level individual subtests actually measure). Working at the narrow level is what distinguishes a clinician from a person reading test manuals. Below: ",
