      "bias_desc": "6 deep sections (overview + 6 validity threats + real biased item examples + fair-assessment checklist + legal landmark cases). The clinician + advocate guide to test bias — what counts as bias (vs gap), how it manifests, how to mitigate, and the case law that shaped modern practice.",
      "big_5_vs_mbti_head_to_head_take_an_ipi": "Big 5 vs MBTI head-to-head. Take an IPIP mini-inventory, see your continuous profile, watch it convert to MBTI, simulate retest flips.",
