      "interview_desc": "5 sections: 12 behavioral questions with STAR hints, 8 tough questions with response tips, 7 interview formats with prep approaches, resume best practices + section-by-section scaffold, post-interview follow-up. The portable career-skill that compounds across every job search.",
      "inventory_desc": "36 public-domain O*NET items. Get your 3-letter Holland code and explore occupations.",
      "is_the_strongest_single_predictor_of_a": " is the strongest single predictor of academic achievement after Gf.",
