      "a_2018_study_wang_ragsdale_traced_the_": "A 2018 study (Wang & Ragsdale) traced the molecular cascade: brooding → optic gland → 7β-OH-cholesterol + estradiol + neuropeptides → cessation of feeding + accelerated aging.",
