      "they_die_too_fast_to_transmit_culture_": " (they die too fast to transmit culture across generations), ",
      "they_eat_crabs_fish_clams_and_are_eate": "They eat crabs + fish + clams AND are eaten by sharks + groupers + sea otters",
      "they_eat_only_algae": "They eat only algae",
      "they_evolved_temporary_color_vision_in": "They evolved temporary color vision in the eyes during stress",
