      "total_yield_rescaled_to_0_to_500": "Total yield (rescaled to 0 to 500)",
      "traditional_fire_practitioners_burn_on": "Traditional fire practitioners burn on days with light dew, gentle breeze, and rising humidity. They start fires at the edges and burn toward the center, letting the fire creep slowly. If conditions change, they let the fire die naturally. This patience — working WITH the weather rather than against it — is what makes cultural burning so safe and effective.",
