      "b3d_rate": "And the rate",
      "b3d_rate_body": "100 to 120 compressions a minute for every age, which is faster than most people expect. The CPR + AED module has a rhythm trainer for exactly this. Keep interruptions as short as you can, and if an AED arrives, turn it on and do what it says.",
      "b3d_rec_done": "Positioned — now keep watching",
      "b3d_rec_done_body": "The recovery position buys a protected airway; it does not end the emergency. Stay with them, keep checking that breathing is still normal, and if it stops or turns to gasping, roll them onto their back and start compressions straight away.",
