      "light_level_geolocators_0_5g_record_su": "Light-level geolocators (0.5g) record sunrise/sunset times. When the bird is recaptured, scientists download the data and calculate latitude (from day length) and longitude (from solar noon timing). Accuracy: ~200 km.",
