      "inquiry_widget_no_score_no_reveal_no_a": "Inquiry widget — no score, no reveal, no answer dump. Legibility heuristics from Tschichold, Bringhurst, Tinker; real reading rates also depend on typeface design, reader age, content density, and lighting.",
      "insufficient_tin_means_the_melting_poi": "Insufficient tin means the melting point is too high and the alloy does not flow well into the matrix. Cast letters come out incomplete around fine details.",
