      "2_material_spec_matches_stock_you_re_c": "2. ✓ Material spec matches stock you're cutting from",
      "2_on_gun_extraction": "2. On-gun extraction: ",
      "2_operator_not_technically_a_welder_di": "2. Operator (not technically a welder — different certification) programs the weld parameters per pipe size + material.",
      "2_take_an_aws_approved_seminar_one_wee": "2. Take an AWS-approved seminar (one week immersive). $1500-3000. Highest ROI for first-time test-takers.",
      "2_thoriated_ewth_2": "2% Thoriated (EWTh-2)",
      "2_transducer_pulses_sound_into_the_par": "2. Transducer pulses sound into the part. Sound travels through metal, reflects off opposite surface, returns.",
      "2_years_of_community_college": "🎓 ~2 years of community college",
      "300_ft": "300 ft",
      "3_4_5_rule": "3-4-5 rule: ",
      "3_all_dimensions_noted_no_missing_meas": "3. ✓ All dimensions noted (no missing measurements)",
      "3_decoder_practice": "3. Decoder Practice",
