      "annual_72_82k_approaching_journey_rate": "Annual $72-82K. Approaching journey rate.",
      "annual_75_95k_pension_is_yours_regardl": "Annual $75-95K. Pension is yours regardless of future moves. Healthcare excellent.",
      "annual_90_120k_typical_top_earners_120": "Annual $90-120K typical. Top earners $120-150K with travel work. Defined-benefit pension.",
