      "underpricing_maine_welders_chronically": "Underpricing (Maine welders chronically underbid each other). No quoting discipline (verbal estimates that become disputes). Equipment failure (one fried machine = month of lost income if no backup). Cash flow gaps (some customers pay 60-90 days). Don't take on jobs you don't have the right equipment for. Don't weld something safety-critical without the qualifications.",
      "underwater_welding": "Underwater Welding",
