      "observe_lever": "The long effort arm travels farther while the load rises.",
      "observe_pulley": "More supporting rope segments share the load.",
      "observe_ramp": "A longer path reduces the force needed.",
      "observe_screw": "Rotation becomes a small, powerful downward move.",
